			"notes": "## What's new\n- Redrawn sprites for all items: flint tools, knives, flint shard, plant fiber and plant string\n\nNo gameplay changes. Fully compatible with worlds from 1.0.0.\n\n## Requirements\n- Minecraft 1.21.1\n- NeoForge 21.1.231 or newer\n\n## Installation\nDownload `pedernaltools-1.1.0+1.21.1.jar` below and place it in your `mods` folder, replacing the 1.0.0 jar.\n\n**Full changelog:** https://github.com/MartDniel/PedernalTools/compare/v1.0.0...v1.1.0"
