			"notes": "First public release of Pedernal Tools.\n\n## Features\n- **Knapping**: right-click flint on stone to get flint shards\n- **Plant fiber & string**: harvest fiber from plants with a flint knife and craft it into plant string\n- **Flint tools**: flint axe and flint pickaxe\n- **Knife progression**: flint → stone → iron → diamond → netherite (via smithing table), up to the Quantum Knife\n\n## Requirements\n- Minecraft 1.21.1\n- NeoForge 21.1.231 or newer\n\n## Installation\nDownload `pedernaltools-1.0.0.jar` below and place it in your `mods` folder."
